@startuml
' Bieu do tuan tu - Chuc nang 1: Tiep nhan xe va chon dich vu/phu tung
' So thu tu thong diep khop 1-1 voi kich ban v.2 trong file Word (63 buoc).
' Trong Visual Paradigm: chuot phai tren bieu do -> Synchronize to Communication Diagram
' de doi sang bieu do cong tac.

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber "<b>0,"

actor "Quản lý" as QL
actor "Khách hàng" as KH
participant LoginView
participant ManagerView
participant SearchCustomerInfoView
participant ServiceSlipInfoView
participant SearchServiceView
participant AddComponentView
participant User
participant Customer
participant Car
participant Appointment
participant ServiceSlip
participant Service
participant ServiceDetail
participant Component
participant ComponentDetail

QL -> LoginView : login
LoginView -> User : call
User -> User : checkLogin()
User --> LoginView : return
LoginView -> ManagerView : call
ManagerView -> QL : show

QL -> ManagerView : choose Tiếp nhận xe và chọn dịch vụ/phụ tùng
ManagerView -> SearchCustomerInfoView : call
SearchCustomerInfoView -> QL : show
QL -> SearchCustomerInfoView : type & search
SearchCustomerInfoView -> Customer : call
Customer -> Customer : findCustomerInfoByPhone()
Customer --> SearchCustomerInfoView : return
SearchCustomerInfoView -> Car : call
Car -> Car : findCarInfosOfCustomer()
Car --> SearchCustomerInfoView : return
SearchCustomerInfoView -> Appointment : call
Appointment -> Appointment : findAppointmentsOfCustomer()
Appointment --> SearchCustomerInfoView : return
SearchCustomerInfoView -> QL : show

QL -> KH : yêu cầu xác nhận thông tin KH/xe
KH -> QL : xác nhận thông tin chính xác

QL -> SearchCustomerInfoView : choose lịch hẹn & click Tiếp nhận
SearchCustomerInfoView -> ServiceSlip : call
ServiceSlip -> ServiceSlip : createServiceSlip()
ServiceSlip --> SearchCustomerInfoView : return
SearchCustomerInfoView -> ServiceSlipInfoView : call
ServiceSlipInfoView -> QL : show

QL -> ServiceSlipInfoView : choose Thêm dịch vụ
ServiceSlipInfoView -> SearchServiceView : call
SearchServiceView -> QL : show

note over QL, SearchServiceView
  Từ bước 32 đến 40 lặp lại cho đến khi chọn xong dịch vụ
end note

QL -> SearchServiceView : type & search
SearchServiceView -> Service : call
Service -> Service : findServicesByKeyword()
Service --> SearchServiceView : return
SearchServiceView -> QL : show
QL -> SearchServiceView : choose dịch vụ
SearchServiceView -> ServiceDetail : call
ServiceDetail -> ServiceDetail : addServiceToSlip()
ServiceDetail --> SearchServiceView : return

QL -> SearchServiceView : choose Thêm phụ tùng
SearchServiceView -> AddComponentView : call
AddComponentView -> QL : show

note over QL, AddComponentView
  Từ bước 44 đến 55 lặp lại cho đến khi chọn xong phụ tùng
end note

QL -> AddComponentView : type & search
AddComponentView -> Component : call
Component -> Component : findComponentByKeyword()
Component --> AddComponentView : return
AddComponentView -> QL : show
QL -> AddComponentView : choose phụ tùng
AddComponentView -> ComponentDetail : call
ComponentDetail -> ComponentDetail : addComponentToSlip()
ComponentDetail --> AddComponentView : return
AddComponentView -> Component : call
Component -> Component : updateInventoryQty()
Component --> AddComponentView : return

QL -> AddComponentView : click Xác nhận lưu phiếu dịch vụ
AddComponentView -> ServiceSlip : call
ServiceSlip -> ServiceSlip : saveServiceSlip()
ServiceSlip --> AddComponentView : return
AddComponentView -> QL : success
QL -> AddComponentView : click OK
AddComponentView -> ManagerView : call
ManagerView -> QL : show

@enduml
